WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
What are you looking at? Chase after

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,030
Master, wait for me

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:11,180
Olaf followed the scent of the spirit beast

4
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,180
Xuewu, you are faster with Xuebao

5
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:20,940
Master, please slow down

6
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:27,030
Junior Brother Chu

7
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:29,030
Why are you and your spirit insects running so fast?

8
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:30,030
Practice more on the mountain

9
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,030
You can do it too

10
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,030
Did Olaf find where she was hiding?

11
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:45,210
Can you find that spiritual beast?

12
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:57,130
Are you saying that this area is all filled with her scent?
